        "notes": "This game contains psychological themes including trauma, death, depression, and self-harm. Players will encounter disturbing imagery, unsettling audio (such as child laughter in eerie contexts), and moments of emotional intensity. The narrative explores loss, memory, identity, and inner conflict through a surreal, cinematic lens. Dialogue and scenes may allude to overdose, suicide, and mental breakdowns, presented in a metaphorical and symbolic environment.\r\n\r\nDiscretion is advised for players sensitive to these topics."
